---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageBanner from '../components/PageBanner.astro';
import famPic from '../../img/fam_pic.jpg';
---

<Base title="About" description="How Griddle Me This, Dad? got started.">
  <PageBanner title="About" />
  <div class="recipe_header_area">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-xl-10">
          <div class="recipe_text text-center">
            <p>
              The inception of <b>Griddle Me This, Dad?</b> began during the current COVID-19 pandemic when I found
              myself with more time on my hands than usual. While perusing online, I found a Blackstone griddle that was
              a really great value, that my wife gave me for my birthday. I have always been passionate about cooking and
              I wanted to take my culinary repertoire beyond the kitchen, to the outdoors.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="whole-wrap">
    <div class="container box_1170">
      <div class="section-top-border">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-md-3">
            <Image src={famPic} alt="The family" width={400} class="img-fluid" />
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-9 mt-sm-20">
            <p>
              Cooking has always been at the heart of our family. Gathering for good times, great conversations, and
              even better food is a common theme at our family gatherings. Taking to my griddle, every meal seemed to be
              a great hit with my fabulous wife and three wonderful sons. Couple my growing fascination to the griddle
              with a kitchen renovation, the griddle became the go-to cooking appliance for this summer.
            </p>
            <br />
            <p>
              I hope you enjoy this site. I would like to thank my beautiful and caring wife for her inspiration, and my
              three wonderful sons for their dedication and support to this ongoing effort. I love you all.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="sample-text-area">
    <div class="container box_1170">
      <h2 class="text-heading h3">Keep in Touch</h2>
      <p>
        Keeping in touch doesn’t have to be a hassle. Subscribe via email to have recipes sent straight to your inbox
        for free and never miss an update! Comments and suggestions on recipes are welcomed on the posts or you can
        email us directly. Beware the Subsquatch!
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
